  const longTranslations=[
    ['Gli standard IBC classificano l’aspetto;','IBC standards classify appearance; they do not provide a universal genetic formula. Shades and trade names do not form a closed list.'],
    ['Blu, steel, verde/turchese; rosso','Blue, steel, green/turquoise; red'],
    ['Profili presenti, ereditarietà cromatica semplificata.','Profiles included, with simplified color inheritance.'],
    ['Neri: melano, black lace, super black','Black: melano, black lace, super black'],
    ['Nero generico. Non deduciamo','Generic black. We do not infer lineage or fertility from color.'],
    ['Giallo, arancio, cellophane, albino','Yellow, orange, cellophane, albino'],
    ['Non ancora riprodotti come profili autonomi.','Not yet represented as separate profiles. Mustard Gas is not solid yellow; cellophane is not albino.'],
    ['Pastel e opaque, bianchi e colorati','Pastel and opaque, white and colored'],
    ['Non ancora autonomi. Dragon','Not yet separate. Dragon is not the same as opaque white.'],
    ['Metallici chiari/scuri, bicolori','Light/dark metallic, bicolor, multicolor, marble, butterfly and grizzle'],
    ['Copertura parziale: Copper','Partial coverage: Copper, Mustard Gas, Marble, Butterfly, Dragon and Koi/Galaxy profiles. The last two are trade names.'],
    ['Le 51 opzioni sono rappresentazioni illustrative,','The 51 options are illustrative representations, not every real color. The experimental model predicts only factors included in the game.'],
    ['Forma delle pinne e livrea sono scelte distinte.','Fin shape and coat are separate choices. Offspring receive one allele per trait from each parent and may inherit hidden traits. In this game model, long fins are dominant and double tails recessive. The experimental model computes parental combinations for Halfmoon/Delta spread, crowning, veil, pointed tail and Dumbo. A and H are additive factors: four doses open the nominal fan from 120° to 200° in 20° steps. Ww gives intermediate webbing and ww a crowntail; V and S scale with dosage, while ee gives Dumbo. These symbols are game conventions, not identified molecular genes.'],
    ['Tutti i pesci 3D sono ricostruzioni parametriche','All 3D fish are parametric reconstructions. Imbellis and Hendra have illustrative natural shapes and coats. Age and sex affect the silhouette without changing alleles. Fry have small, slender bodies, relatively large heads, developing fins and emerging pigmentation. Sex differences appear gradually.'],
    ['La crescita usa mesi di gioco:','Growth uses game months: fry at 0, juveniles at 1, growing breeders at 2–3 and full development from 4. This does not simulate embryos or the first hours after hatching. Size, proportions and pigmentation follow illustrative curves rather than biological measurements; Imbellis, Hendra and hybrid values are uncalibrated extrapolations. Sex is assigned independently at birth at 50/50 and does not represent visual diagnosis of fry or a dmrt1 model.'],
    ['Nel gioco tutte le specie e gli ibridi possono incrociarsi,','In the game, every species and hybrid can cross, including later generations. This is a creative choice inspired by genetics, not a prediction of real compatibility or fertility. Offspring inherit parental traits and average ancestry shares; these percentages are not measured DNA. Age, sex and monthly rest requirements still apply.'],
    ['Il fattore blu del gioco assume dominanza incompleta:','The game’s blue factor uses incomplete dominance: BB produces steel blue, Bb royal blue and bb turquoise. Each offspring draws one allele per locus from each parent.'],
    ['Marble è trattato come tratto ereditabile','Marble is modeled as an inherited trait with variable expression: its pattern changes with age and each fish has a separate seed. Butterfly, iridescence, black and copper are visual simplifications. Real color depends on many loci, regulation and environment. Game percentages do not reliably predict real broods. The main forecast covers fin length and double tails; the experimental section adds adult forms, carriers, spread, Dumbo, veil, pointed tails, blue and other color factors. It distinguishes inherited blue from masking by double-dose red, black or copper. This predicts game rules and is not biologically validated: it assumes independent loci and does not model linkage, fertility, mortality or environment. Marginal probabilities may overlap; four births need not match expected proportions.'],
    ['Il modello è ispirato alla ricerca,','The model is inspired by research, distinguishing documented effects from hypotheses. Blue distribution follows the observed direction for'],
    ['suggerisce una variazione della tonalità rossa.','suggests a shift in red hue. In the game, effect strength, interactions among copper, green and gold, and patterns of seven original coats are hypothetical. I, R and N are invented factors, not real genes. Appearance also depends on seed, age and viewing angle.'],
    ['Il framment shader usa gradient noise','The fragment shader uses gradient noise and domain warping for marble patches and a distorted butterfly band on fins. Iridescence combines apparent normal, Fresnel and rim light with steel, royal or turquoise colors. “Super black” is an aesthetic rendering, not a certified single allele.'],
    ['Carey et al., 2016: pigmentazione','Carey et al., 2016: larval and juvenile pigmentation'],
    ['IBC: forme maschili e femminili','IBC: male and female forms'],
    ['Verifica funzionale di alkal2l e bco1l','Functional validation of alkal2l and bco1l'],
    ['Incroci reciproci Splendens × Imbellis','Reciprocal Splendens × Imbellis crosses'],
    ['Studio sperimentale Splendens × Imbellis','Experimental Splendens × Imbellis study'],
    ['Evidenze genomiche','Genomic evidence']
  ];
